sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Gradio UI
    participant E as Chat engine
    participant L as Ollama (GPU)
    participant T as Tools
    U->>UI: "Suggest 3 alternatives for part A100"
    UI->>E: history + settings
    E->>L: chat(messages, tools, stream)
    L-->>E: tool_call find_alternative_parts(A100, k=3)
    E->>T: run tool
    T-->>E: JSON (IDs, scores, descriptions)
    E-->>UI: 🔧 "Tool used" message
    E->>L: chat(messages + tool result)
    L-->>E: streamed answer tokens
    E-->>UI: markdown table, streamed
    UI-->>U: answer + tok/s stats
